      "side": 1,
      "message": "While `kCTFontVariationAxesAttribute` is available in iOS11+, it wasn\u0027t actually in the SDK until iPhoneOS14.0.sdk. The failing builds are using iPhoneOS13.4.sdk which is too old to list it.\n\nWhile XCode 14 requires macOS 12.5+, XCode 13 requires macOS 11.3+ but Skia\u0027s builds are apparently running with its compiler and SDK on macOS10.15.7. So maybe we can update?",
      "parentUuid": "47aa6590_d2381e4c",
      "revId": "c1f2dd0fc5f632c32a603d4dcf539ea85d0554a5",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
